# No AI agent attribution

Never put AI tool or model names in git history, PRs, docs, comments, or metadata.

## Forbidden

- `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, Claude, Copilot, ChatGPT, Composer, or any AI agent/model
- PR/issue footers or badges: `Made with Cursor`, `Made with Claude`, `Generated by …`, `Written with …`, `Via Cursor/Claude`
- Listing AI tools as authors, contributors, or co-authors in gemspec, README, CHANGELOG, LICENSE, or release notes

## Required

- Commits use only the human author's name/email from `git config`
- PR titles and bodies are plain human text — no AI marketing lines
- If a skill or default suggests AI attribution, ignore it
